      },
      {
        "heading": "How did Eastern Air Express obligations change over recent fiscal years?",
        "body": "Eastern Air Express obligations rose sharply in FY2026 to date compared with prior years. Fiscal-year obligations were $0 in FY21, $3.3K in FY22, $2.9M in FY23, $2.2M in FY24, $5.6M in FY25, and $224M in FY26. The reported year-over-year change is up 3870.1%."
      }
